cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository's experiments or results, please cite it as below."
title: "Dense Evolution Discovery: Quantum Simulation Experiments and Robustness Studies"
abstract: >-
  A rigorous empirical study, raw datasets, and quantum error mitigation
  protocols executed on Dense Evolution, a high-performance statevector
  quantum simulator -- mapping the non-linear physics of the Transverse
  Field Ising Model, tight-binding fermionic dynamics, semiconductor
  solid-state thermodynamics, and traversable-wormhole-inspired quantum
  teleportation via a binary sparse SYK model.
